WEBVTT

00:22.510 --> 00:23.890
Your eye is next.

00:24.920 --> 00:25.840
Show me you're afraid.

00:27.810 --> 00:28.890
Don't, Fox!

00:36.720 --> 00:37.590
Snake...

00:41.350 --> 00:45.086
Aw, man. He's in rough shape.

00:45.110 --> 00:50.040
B-Boss, welcome back.
Wh-Wh-When did you get here?

00:51.060 --> 00:52.290
Fox.

00:52.790 --> 00:53.920
Yes, sir.

00:55.480 --> 00:56.486
Come closer.

00:56.510 --> 00:57.650
Y-Yes, sir.

01:07.640 --> 01:08.626
Badger.

01:08.650 --> 01:09.840
Yes, sir!

01:10.310 --> 01:11.570
Explain.

01:14.630 --> 01:16.660
Yes, sir.

01:20.390 --> 01:21.650
Idiots.

01:25.720 --> 01:27.740
You're a bunch of idiots.

01:27.990 --> 01:28.446
Awakening.

01:28.470 --> 01:32.006
What's the point of
you guys bullying the slaves?

01:32.030 --> 01:34.210
The young master's gotta do it himself.

01:35.060 --> 01:36.816
Yeah, b-but he...

01:36.840 --> 01:42.100
H-He... got cheeky with us, so...

01:59.540 --> 02:03.480
Sorry. These guys are idiots.

02:05.820 --> 02:07.220
I'm Snake.

02:09.270 --> 02:10.390
I'm Thorfinn.

02:57.940 --> 02:59.830
See that, Thorfinn?

03:00.900 --> 03:04.600
Your body says it wants to live.

03:13.420 --> 03:14.626
I'm going to sleep.

03:14.650 --> 03:17.940
You guys had better
graciously see them back home.

03:21.030 --> 03:22.960
I know I don't have to tell you...

03:24.660 --> 03:28.420
that the day you cause
any more trouble over this matter,

03:29.330 --> 03:35.190
you won't be able to chew
your own food anymore.

03:38.320 --> 03:39.396
I didn't hear a "Yes, sir."

03:39.420 --> 03:40.880
Yes, sir!

03:46.660 --> 03:49.600
Thorfinn, you...

03:52.420 --> 03:55.140
Do I want to live?

04:01.460 --> 04:02.400
Live...

04:07.560 --> 04:10.420
Live, and do what?

06:00.610 --> 06:01.650
I see.

06:02.450 --> 06:06.240
Besides your ear,
none of your injuries are very deep.

06:07.430 --> 06:09.480
Once they're healed, you'll be good as new.

06:13.230 --> 06:16.756
I'm sorry you two had to go through that.

06:16.780 --> 06:22.530
The master doesn't know what to do
about his guests' misbehavior either.

06:23.080 --> 06:24.420
"Misbehavior?"

06:24.870 --> 06:27.520
Their "misbehavior" nearly got us killed.

06:28.250 --> 06:32.160
It's not as though
they'd actually kill you.

06:33.590 --> 06:34.480
You're wrong.

06:36.040 --> 06:40.340
If their boss Snake hadn't shown up,
they really would've killed us.

06:42.180 --> 06:48.470
Guys like them think our lives are
worth less than those of insects.

06:50.980 --> 06:52.900
Either way, we couldn't help it.

06:55.540 --> 06:58.400
The strong kill the weak.

06:59.570 --> 07:01.120
It's only natural.

07:03.160 --> 07:06.096
What did you just say?

07:06.120 --> 07:08.200
Now, now, Einar.

07:09.030 --> 07:14.520
If they try to mess with you again,
come talk to me instead of going with them.

07:15.900 --> 07:18.846
More importantly,
we can't allow your wounds to fester.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.380
I'll put some medicine on them.

07:21.440 --> 07:22.640
Medicine?

07:22.990 --> 07:25.906
U-Uh, Pater, we don't...

07:25.930 --> 07:28.760
Don't worry about paying
me for the medicine.

07:29.230 --> 07:33.090
It's my responsibility
to look after you two.

07:34.580 --> 07:38.020
I'm sorry I struck a nerve.

07:40.740 --> 07:44.790
No, it's fine. Thank you.

07:46.590 --> 07:50.500
You'd better thank Arnheid, too.

07:51.000 --> 07:56.020
She ran all around the farm
to tell me what happened.

08:02.920 --> 08:05.856
Rest for today.

08:05.880 --> 08:09.006
I'll talk to the master about it.

08:09.030 --> 08:10.270
Also...

08:10.790 --> 08:13.846
It's one of my old shirts,
so it's probably a bit large for you,

08:13.870 --> 08:15.770
but Thorfinn, you can have this.

08:16.140 --> 08:20.020
After all, yours is full of holes
after what they did.

08:27.360 --> 08:31.410
Don't you have anything to say to Pater?

08:37.520 --> 08:42.496
Listen, you. You're supposed to say
"thank you" in these situations.

08:42.520 --> 08:43.270
Go on.

08:48.910 --> 08:50.360
Say it.

08:51.660 --> 08:54.366
Why haven't you been
saying anything, anyway?

08:54.390 --> 08:57.670
It's not nice,
when everyone's being kind to you.

08:58.960 --> 09:03.160
It's fine. I know Thorfinn
doesn't say much.

09:10.130 --> 09:11.490
Thank you.

09:31.630 --> 09:33.800
Hey, where are you going?

09:35.240 --> 09:38.210
He said we don't have to
harvest wheat today.

09:39.880 --> 09:40.810
I'm going to the woods.

09:41.350 --> 09:43.190
These injuries are nothing.

09:50.340 --> 09:53.160
Wait up. I'll go with you.

10:27.960 --> 10:31.440
The way he moved when Snake attacked him...

10:34.130 --> 10:35.800
He's no ordinary man.

10:38.660 --> 10:39.720
And...

10:43.990 --> 10:46.850
The strong kill the weak.

10:48.710 --> 10:50.680
It's only natural.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.150
Thorfinn.

11:04.770 --> 11:08.530
Have you ever been to war?

11:13.140 --> 11:13.840
Yes.

11:20.770 --> 11:24.120
Have you killed people?

11:26.440 --> 11:27.200
Yes.

11:36.420 --> 11:37.620
How many?

11:39.780 --> 11:43.250
Five men? Ten?

11:49.670 --> 11:51.640
Why do you want to know?

11:52.960 --> 11:55.520
I thought you didn't like war.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.210
Timber.

12:22.660 --> 12:24.980
I don't remember how many.

12:28.610 --> 12:30.320
I've killed a lot of people.

12:32.850 --> 12:36.950
I was on the battlefield since
around the time I was five or six.

12:38.230 --> 12:41.440
I joined the Danish army's
invasion of England.

12:49.110 --> 12:51.600
I was a warrior.

12:55.760 --> 12:58.040
Do you hate me now, Einar?

13:47.300 --> 13:50.260
I was a warrior.

13:51.800 --> 13:54.230
Do you hate me now, Einar?

14:37.620 --> 14:40.200
I don't remember how many.

14:54.260 --> 14:55.880
I've killed a lot of people.

16:15.370 --> 16:17.880
Found you.

16:20.710 --> 16:27.510
Damn kid. Die!

16:36.450 --> 16:38.790
You brat.

16:40.440 --> 16:45.450
Kill. Kill him. Die!

17:13.640 --> 17:14.640
Damn it!

18:47.810 --> 18:48.790
Einar...

18:53.890 --> 18:59.590
Why do you wake me
every time I cry out in my sleep?

19:12.770 --> 19:17.280
I've killed people. I've
killed a lot of people.

19:19.110 --> 19:26.080
From battle to battle, I've attacked
villages and killed a lot of people.

19:28.320 --> 19:33.400
I'm no different from the people

19:36.080 --> 19:37.680
who killed your family.

19:57.070 --> 19:58.320
Do you...

20:00.120 --> 20:04.040
Does anything good come from being alive?

20:07.510 --> 20:08.920
Not for me.

20:12.760 --> 20:20.100
Not a single good thing has
happened to me in my entire life.

20:30.310 --> 20:34.240
Do you want to die?

20:35.340 --> 20:40.196
I don't know what kind of
terrible fate you've suffered.

20:40.220 --> 20:43.750
I don't want to know what kind of hell
you've lived through, either.

20:45.170 --> 20:53.950
But we're able to chit-chat,
eat, shit, and sleep in this hell...

21:01.800 --> 21:06.420
because someone kept us alive.

21:08.550 --> 21:10.340
How can you say nothing good's
ever happened to you?

21:17.170 --> 21:18.440
You're wrong.

21:21.510 --> 21:23.280
You're wrong!

21:26.850 --> 21:27.920
Asshole.

21:30.290 --> 21:31.800
Don't act so spoiled.

21:58.600 --> 22:00.040
Besides...

22:02.270 --> 22:06.660
It's not like you killed my family.

22:10.920 --> 22:12.530
Don't be so arrogant.

22:26.520 --> 22:30.400
Thank you, Einar.

22:33.410 --> 22:37.550
Thank you for waking me.

22:45.310 --> 22:46.390
Jeez...

22:47.370 --> 22:51.380
I can't get enough sleep because
you won't stop talking in yours.

22:54.050 --> 22:55.240
I see.

23:01.240 --> 23:03.316
I'm sorry, Einar.

23:03.340 --> 23:05.110
Just go to sleep already.

25:36.350 --> 25:37.776
Path of Blood.

25:37.800 --> 25:39.300
"Path of Blood."
